\textbf{Subject: Application for the \targetrole{} role}

Dear Hiring Manager,

I am writing to apply for the \targetrole{} role at \targetcompany{}. I have 3 years of
experience building REST APIs and backend services in Python with Django and FastAPI, most
recently on a fintech platform for NBFC lenders. I am available to join immediately.

From May to November 2026, I was a Software Engineer at SurePass Technologies on finpass.ai,
SurePass's RBI Account Aggregator business, which delivers customer financial data to NBFC lenders.
I developed the consent management system, covering creation, approval, revocation and expiry in
line with the RBI AA framework, and built a data vault that stores and serves financial information
received from multiple aggregators. I also integrated several AAs and TSPs behind one interface with
failover, so lenders still receive data when a provider fails. On the bank statement analyzer, I
redesigned bank detection in the statement parser and cut its Gemini API cost by 97\%, from about
INR 1.48 lakh to INR 5,000 a month.

Before that, I spent two years at In2IT Technologies building backend services for three products.
For iProvision, a network inventory and device management platform serving more than 10,000
concurrent users, I developed REST APIs for device operations over SNMP and NETCONF/RESTCONF. Redis
caching, Celery queues and PostgreSQL tuning brought its API latency down from 800 ms to 250 ms and
tripled its capacity. I also built the CI/CD pipeline with Docker, GitHub Actions and Jenkins at more
than 85\% test coverage, which led to 35\% fewer production bugs and 60\% faster deployments.

Outside work, I write and maintain two FastAPI libraries on PyPI: fastapi-tenancy, which provides
multi-tenancy with four isolation strategies, and fastapi-locale, which provides
internationalization. Two of my pull requests to SQLAlchemy were released in version 2.1.0b1. I am
currently building Credit Desk, an AI assistant for NBFC credit teams that answers RBI questions with
the source paragraphs cited and drafts credit notes for an analyst to approve. I hold an M.Tech in
Computer Science and Engineering.

I write backend code that is tested, typed and easy for the next engineer to change, and I would
bring that to your team. My resume is attached, and I am happy to share code samples or complete
a technical assignment. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute.

Thank you for your time and consideration.

Sincerely,\\[2pt]
\textbf{Kapil Dagur}

